Inverse kinematics (src/anim/ik.c): algorithms, re-implemented in C
  - three.js r186 CCDIKSolver (examples/jsm/animation/CCDIKSolver.js), whose
    semantics cw_ccdik_solve follows. Copyright 2010-2026 three.js authors, MIT license.
    https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js
